[l_english.EQUIPMENT_TANK_LIGHT_RAM]
Battering Ram (Light Tank)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_TANK_LIGHT_RAM_desc]
The battering ram, or as some refer to it, the “The Super Steady Castle Squeezy 6000”, is a marvel of engineering designed to break down the barriers of hostility and bring friendship crashing through the door. When life gives you lemons, make lemonade. When life gives you a battering ram, make a battering ram shaped hole in the wall.
§g“Hello? Hello? Yeah, it’s me again. Yeah, I lost my keys again.”§!

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_TANK_LIGHT_RAM_short]
Battering Ram

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_TANK_LIGHT_RAM]
攻城槌 (轻型坦克)

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_TANK_LIGHT_RAM_desc]
攻城槌，或者有些小马称之为“超级稳定城堡榨汁机6000”，是一种工程奇迹，旨在打破敌意的阻隔，带着友谊破门而入。当生活给你柠檬时，就做柠檬汁；当生活给你一辆攻城槌时，就在墙上开一个攻城槌形状的洞。
§g“喂？喂？对，又是我。对，我又丢钥匙了。”§!

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_TANK_LIGHT_RAM_short]
攻城槌
